g></span></div>\n          <p class=\"card-title\">Apartment in Chiado</p><p class=\"card-meta\">$228 for 2 nights · ★4.97</p></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"thumb g3\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Bright apartment interior — Алан Албегов on Pexels\" style=\"background-image:url('https://images.pexels.com/photos/27023868/pexels-photo-27023868.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=500');background-size:cover;background-position:center;\"><div class=\"thumb-shape\"></div><span class=\"heart\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,.35)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7.5-4.6-10-9.3C.6 8 2.4 4.7 5.7 4.2c2-.3 3.7.7 6.3 3.1 2.6-2.4 4.3-3.4 6.3-3.1 3.3.5 5.1 3.8 3.7 7.5C19.5 16.4 12 21 12 21Z\"></path></svg></span></div>\n          <p class=\"card-title\">Apartment in Lisbon</p><p class=\"card-meta\">$251 for 2 nights · ★4.88</p></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"thumb g6\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Bedroom with cushions — Max Vakhtbovych on Pexels\" style=\"background-image:url('https://images.pexels.com/photos/7045991/pexels-photo-7045991.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=500');background-size:cover;background-position:center;\"><div class=\"thumb-shape\"></div><span class=\"badge-pill\">Guest favorite</span><span class=\"heart\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"rgba(0,0,0,.35)\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><path d=\"M12 21s-7.5-4.6-10-9.3C.6 8 2.4 4.7 5.7 4.2c2-.3 3.7.7 6.3 3.1 2.6-2.4 4.3-3.4 6.3-3.1 3.3.5 5.1 3.8 3.7 7.5C19.5 16.4 12 21 12 21Z\"></path></svg></span></div>\n          <p class=\"card-title\">Casa in Lisbon</p><p class=\"card-meta\">$164 for 2 nights · ★4.94</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"row-head\">\n        <h2>Stay in Austin</h2>\n        <div class=\"row-nav\">\n          <button aria-label=\"Previous\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"><path d=\"m15 6-6 6 6 6\"